job_description:
Job Responsibility:

Monitor and maintain building systems, including HVAC, electrical, plumbing, fire protection, and security systems.

Plan and oversee preventive and corrective maintenance activities.

Troubleshoot and resolve facility-related issues to minimize downtime.

Coordinate with vendors, contractors, and service providers for repair and improvement works.

Ensure compliance with health, safety, and environmental regulations.

Support space planning and workplace optimization projects.

Manage facility assets, maintenance records, and documentation.

Assist with budgeting and cost control for facilities operations.

Conduct routine inspections to identify potential hazards or inefficiencies.

Respond to emergency facility situations as needed.

Other requirements at the customer's site


Job Requirement:

1. Bachelor’s Degree in Mechanical, Electrical, or Facilities Engineering or a related field;

2. Able to adapt to short-term overtime work (pre-construction phase, later normal working hours);

3. Have more than one year working experience in facilities management or building maintenance;

4. Familiar in using Building Management Systems (BMS) or Computerized Maintenance Management Systems (CMMS);

5. Strong knowledge of building systems, equipment, and maintenance procedures;

6. Correct working attitude, strong learning ability, good operation and maintenance habits, strong execution ability and sense of responsibility, good communication ability, service awareness, able to withstand pressure;

7. Intuitive understanding of IDC infrastructure and power environment (air conditioning, power, temperature, humidity, etc.)

Min. lulusan SMA/SMK/Sederajat;

Memiliki sertifikasi/pernah mengikuti kursus servis Smartphone/Elektronik lebih diutamakan;

Memiliki pengalaman min. 2 tahun sebagai Teknisi HP/Teknisi TV;

Memahami secara garis besar komponen-komponen dalam Smartphone;

Mengerti Elektronika Dasar dan Welding;

Memiliki kemampuan dan pengalaman dalam berinteraksi dengan customer;

Jujur, teliti, bertanggung jawab, dan dapat bekerja sama dalam tim;

Dapat bergabung secepatnya;

Area penempatan di Xiaomi Solo.

工作职责：

负责公司信息系统的实施、上线、用户培训及问题处理，例如MES系统的生产；

负责MES系统运行过程中的故障排除，高效处理并解决系统中出现的各种异常问题，确保系统稳定运行；

收集并分析业务用户需求，了解需求，并跟进团队MES系统的开发，进行迭代优化；

根据需要编写技术文档并为员工提供功能培训；

负责生产数据报告和生产看板的开发和维护；

负责公司数据机房服务器和网络的管理、配置和维护；

负责公共IT设备（如计算机终端、打印机和视频会议设备）的管理和维护；

负责IT资产的管理，并确保IT资产的准确性；

完成领导分配的其他任务。


Job Responsibilities：

Responsible for the implementation, launch of the company's information system, and user training and problem handling, such as production of MES systems;

Responsible for troubleshooting during the operation of the MES system, promptly dealing with and solving various abnormal problems that occur in the system, and ensuring the stable operation of the system;

Collect and analyze the needs of business users, understand the needs, and follow up on the group's MES development for iterative optimization;

Write technical documents and provide functional training to employees as needed;

Responsible for the development and maintenance of production data reports and production boards;

Responsible for the management, configuration and maintenance of the company's data room server and network;

Responsible for the management and maintenance of public IT equipment such as terminal computers, printers and video conferencing;

Responsible for the management of IT assets and ensuring the accuracy of IT assets;

Complete other tasks assigned by the leader.







职位要求：

1. 计算机或软件工程专业；

2. 两年以上MES系统实施和运维经验；

3. 具备良好的沟通能力和团队合作能力，能够与不同部门和团队有效沟通；

4. 具有较强的责任心和职业素养，能够承受工作压力和挑战；

5. 具有较强的学习能力和问题解决能力，能够快速适应新技术和新问题。




Job requirements:

1. Majors in computer and software engineering;

2. More than 2 years of experience in implementing and operating the MES system;

3. Have good communication skills and teamwork skills, and be able to communicate effectively with different departments and teams;

4. Have a strong sense of responsibility and professionalism, and be able to bear work pressures and challenges;

5. Have strong learning ability and problem-solving ability, and be able to quickly adapt to new technologies and problems.

PT Digital Solusi Prima is an IT services and system integrator company focused on cybersecurity, AI, and cyber intelligence technologies. We deliver solutions that support real-world operational and security needs across various industries.

Responsibilities:

Design end-to-end solution architecture (application, data, infrastructure, and integration) aligned with operational and security requirements;

Translate client and business needs into practical, scalable, and secure solutions;

Develop solution approaches by combining internal capabilities with relevant third-party technologies;

Lead or support client discussions, technical presentations, and solution proposals

Work closely with sales, engineering, and delivery teams to ensure alignment from pre-sales through implementation;

Provide input on solution design, feasibility, and effort estimation;

Step in hands-on when needed to support implementation and ensure alignment between design and execution;

Ensure solutions adhere to best practices in performance, scalability, reliability, and cybersecurity.


Job Requirements:

Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or related field;

5–8 years of experience in IT, system integration, cybersecurity, or related technical roles, with prior experience in the banking or financial services industry being highly preferred;

Strong understanding of system architecture, networking, and infrastructure or cloud environments;

Familiarity with cybersecurity solutions such as firewalls, SIEM, vulnerability management, or security monitoring;

Understanding of system integration concepts, including APIs and data flow;

Experience in client-facing engagements (solution discussions, technical presentations, or proposals);

Ability to translate operational and business needs into effective, practical technical solutions;

Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving skills;

Good communication skills, able to engage both technical and non-technical stakeholders;

Comfortable working in a dynamic, fast-paced, solution-driven environment;

Proactive mindset with strong ownership and willingness to continuously learn new technologies.
